== r3.81, CANON-13 Q1: Fill into an array of a Range checks the value once,
== as any store into the Range: outside it, the program stops.
Type
    TMonth Range 1..12

Main :
    M TMonth := 12
    Months Array[1..3] TMonth := Fill(M + 1)
    PutLn(Months[1])
;
